{"products":[{"id":16081508270412,"title":"RunOrFit Flex Belt","handle":"runorfit-flex-belt","body_html":"\u003cdiv style=\"margin:0 0 26px\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;padding:10px 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.45\"\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"display:inline-block;width:16px;flex:0 0 16px;color:#0d7a4f;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5\"\u003e✓\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAny two items, A$20 off\u003c\/strong\u003e; two belts come to A$79.90, applied automatically at checkout\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e3e5e9;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.45\"\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"display:inline-block;width:16px;flex:0 0 16px;color:#0d7a4f;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5\"\u003e✓\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFree tracked delivery across Australia\u003c\/strong\u003e; every order, no minimum spend\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e3e5e9;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.45\"\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"display:inline-block;width:16px;flex:0 0 16px;color:#0d7a4f;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5\"\u003e✓\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eArrives in about 7–15 business days\u003c\/strong\u003e; 1–3 to pack, 6–12 in transit\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e3e5e9;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.45\"\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"display:inline-block;width:16px;flex:0 0 16px;color:#0d7a4f;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5\"\u003e✓\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e30 days to change your mind\u003c\/strong\u003e; on top of your Australian Consumer Law rights\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #e3e5e9;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.45\"\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"display:inline-block;width:16px;flex:0 0 16px;color:#0d7a4f;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5\"\u003e✓\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShop Pay, Apple Pay, Google Pay\u003c\/strong\u003e, and all major cards\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin:13px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e3e5e9;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#5d626b\"\u003eNot sure it will sit right at your waist? Email \u003ca href=\"mailto:hello@runorfit.com\"\u003ehello@runorfit.com\u003c\/a\u003e with the measurement you need and we will tell you before you order, within two business days.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cp\u003eMost running belts solve one problem and create another: the pouch is big enough for a phone, so it bounces. This one is cut flat and narrow, and the strap is elastic rather than webbing, so the load sits against you instead of swinging off you.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe pocket measures 20 × 10 cm.\u003c\/strong\u003e A 6.7-inch phone lies flat inside it with room left for a key and a card; you do not have to wedge it in diagonally. Beside the main pocket there is a smaller pocket for cards and cash, a hook-and-loop flap pocket for keys, and a \u003cstrong\u003eport on the side for a headphone cable\u003c\/strong\u003e, so your phone can stay zipped in while you listen.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eSpecification\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Main pocket 20 × 10 cm, zip closure, three-dimensional cut that holds its shape when loaded\u003cbr\u003e• Second pocket for cards and cash, plus a hook-and-loop flap pocket for keys\u003cbr\u003e• Side port for a headphone cable\u003cbr\u003e• Elastic strap with side-release buckle, adjustable to approximately 70 cm total\u003cbr\u003e• Reflective strip across the front\u003cbr\u003e• Nylon, with moulded plastic buckle\u003cbr\u003e• 85 g\u003cbr\u003e• Six colours: Black, Blue, Lime, Grey, Orange, Pink\u003cbr\u003e• Unisex\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eGood to know before you order\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIt is not waterproof.\u003c\/strong\u003e The fabric is woven nylon and the zip is not sealed. It shrugs off sweat and light rain; it will not keep a phone dry in a downpour.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe reflective strip is a visibility aid, not safety apparel.\u003c\/strong\u003e It lights up when a driver's headlights fall on it. It is not certified high-visibility clothing and it does not replace lights or bright clothing after dark.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eDelivery\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFree tracked shipping across Australia\u003c\/strong\u003e, with no minimum spend. Processing takes 1–3 business days and transit normally takes 6–12 business days, so most orders arrive within 7–15 business days of ordering. These are estimates, not guaranteed dates. If your order has not arrived within 30 business days of dispatch, we resend it or refund you in full, at your choice.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-09-10T10:02:46+10:00","created_at":"2026-09-10T10:02:46+10:00","updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:52:56+11:00","vendor":"RunOrFit","product_type":"Running belt","tags":["australia","belt","belts-storage","bestseller","mens","new-in","race-day","running","runorfit","unisex","womens"],"variants":[{"id":58751462048076,"title":"Black","option1":"Black","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"CJNS1660349-Black","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":{"id":77164864078156,"product_id":16081508270412,"position":1,"created_at":"2026-09-10T18:41:16+10:00","updated_at":"2026-09-10T18:41:18+10:00","alt":"RunOrFit Flex Belt in black, laid flat, showing the zip pocket and the reflective strip","width":800,"height":800,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1091\/9431\/4060\/files\/13_80cffcf7-8e13-4cdd-93a1-d7f853434b4a.jpg?v=1789029678","