ree lengths rather than sold as one-size-fits-all; which is the usual reason armbands slide down.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe phone sits in a stretch sleeve with a clear window, so you can read the screen and use it through the cover without taking the phone out.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eSpecification\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Soft stretch fabric with a hook-and-loop closure\u003cbr\u003e• Clear touch-through window over the screen\u003cbr\u003e• Three sizes: S, M and L, sized by upper-arm circumference\u003cbr\u003e• Three colours: Blue, Rose Gold, Silver\u003cbr\u003e• One armband per order\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eGood to know before you order\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIt is not waterproof.\u003c\/strong\u003e The fabric handles sweat and light rain. It will not keep a phone dry in a downpour, and it is not a swimming or watersports product.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCheck your phone against the sleeve measurement, not just the model name.\u003c\/strong\u003e A large phone in a thick case may not fit. The measurement guide is in the product images.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChoose your size from your arm measurement.\u003c\/strong\u003e An armband that is too large is the one that slips; going up a size is not the safe option here.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eDelivery and returns\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFree tracked shipping across Australia\u003c\/strong\u003e, with no minimum spend. Processing takes 1–3 business days and transit normally takes 6–12 business days, so most orders arrive within 7–15 business days of ordering. These are estimates, not guaranteed dates. If your order has not arrived within 30 business days of dispatch, we resend it or refund you in full, at your choice.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-09-28T22:26:36+10:00","created_at":"2026-09-28T22:26:33+10:00","updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:52:56+11:00","vendor":"RunOrFit","product_type":"Running Access